          <p>
            If your child loved tapping every tree, cloud, and critter in <em>Sago Mini Forest Flyer</em> to see a delightful animation, <strong><a href="/discovery/">Kidamame Discovery</a></strong> takes that exact joy of tactile, rule-free exploration and elevates it for <strong>children ages 4–10</strong>.
